Your successful melee hits apply a stacking effect that decreases damage done by [1%, 1%, 2%, 2%, 3% (TL1-5)].

You can have up to 8 stacks per target and further attacks refresh the duration, but any turn you are farther than [2, 3, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] spaces from the victim the fear will wear off quickly.

At level 3 it also slows by [0.00%, 0.00%, 1.25%, 1.25%, 1.25% (TL1-5)] per stack.

At level 5 you can horrify enemies in a radius of [0, 0, 0, 0, 1 (TL1-5)].

This talent ignores saves and immunities.
